  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renovation of the Ethno House in Kys&#xE1;&#x10D;, Serbia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">San&#xE1;cia a adapt&#xE1;cia Etno domu v Kys&#xE1;&#x10D;i</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Kult&#xFA;rne centrum Kys&#xE1;&#x10D; dost&#xE1;lo od mesta Nov&#xFD; Sad na pou&#x17E;ivanie star&#xFD; dom pre otvorenie Etno domu a m&#xFA;zeum star&#xFD;ch vec&#xED; z Kys&#xE1;&#x10D;a a Vojvodiny. Star&#xFD; dom je v nevyhovuj&#xFA;com stave a vy&#x17E;aduje si kompletn&#xFA; rekon&#x161;trukciu. Realizovan&#xED;m projektu sa v obnoven&#xFD;ch priestoroch bud&#xFA; m&#xF4;c&#x165; realizova&#x165; r&#xF4;zne liter&#xE1;rne, divadeln&#xE9; a folkl&#xF3;rne programy.&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The building was built in 1908 and is in very insuficient&#xA0; technical condition. The complete reconstruction of the building will provide possibilities for organizing literary, theatrical and folklore events.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
